 "notes": "Exact model measured on AE 2026 8 bpc (full 0..255 LUT, 0 mismatches in both visible settings): un-premultiply, c^2.4 (pure 2.4 power, not piecewise sRGB), *2^Exposure + Offset, max(0)^(1/Gamma), ^(1/2.4), clamp, re-premultiply; alpha untouched; fully transparent pixels stay 0. Bypass Linear Light Conversion (22) skips both 2.4 powers. Individual Channels (1 = 2) uses only the per-channel groups (Master ignored) - assumed from the AE UI, not measured against an AE render; same for Bypass (22). Unverified edge cases: a negative intermediate (negative Offset) is clamped to 0 before the gamma (identical for 8 bpc output whether AE clamps or uses a sign-preserving pow); AE in 32 bpc would keep values above 1 / below 0 (not reproduced, the Rive canvas is 8 bpc). Group headers 2/6/7/11/12/16/17/21 and Compositing Options (23) are not image parameters.",
